# createDatabaseIfNotExist=true: Instructs MySQL to create the product_db schema automatically if it does not already exist.

# serverTimezone=UTC: Eliminates timezone handshake warnings between the Java VM and the database server.

# spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update: Hibernate will inspect your @Entity classes (like Product.java) 
and create the products table automatically without dropping existing records on restart.



# %C{1.}: The class name abbreviated (e.g., c.e.s.j.h.s.ProductService or the simple class name ProductService 
if configured as %C{1}).

# %L: The exact line number in the source code where log.info(...) or log.error(...) was executed.

# %m%n: The log message followed by a system newline.